WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.922
Everyone got on the skytrain.

2
00:00:04.923 --> 00:00:08.457
It drove through clouds. Huge windmills

3
00:00:08.458 --> 00:00:14.103
floated in the air. "Those

4
00:00:14.104 --> 00:00:17.360
are amazing!" Ringo's mom said.

5
00:00:17.361 --> 00:00:19.365
Ringo looked down and

6
00:00:19.366 --> 00:00:22.333
gulped. "We're really high up."

7
00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:30.897
The train stopped at a

8
00:00:30.898 --> 00:00:34.074
platform. A windmill sat there.

9
00:00:34.075 --> 00:00:46.357
Mom checked the windmill. "Some

10
00:00:46.358 --> 00:00:49.687
