13
00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:04.940
"I can fix the windmill," she said.

14
00:01:04.941 --> 00:01:09.698
"Lucy is smart," Ringo's mom said.

15
00:01:09.699 --> 00:01:17.222
Ringo rolled his eyes. "Finished!" Lucy said.

16
00:01:17.223 --> 00:01:23.932
"See, Lars? I fixed it

17
00:01:23.933 --> 00:01:27.566
