18
00:01:27.567 --> 00:01:30.116
"Stand back, Tiny,"

19
00:01:30.117 --> 00:01:33.301
Lucy said. "PJ, turn it

20
00:01:33.302 --> 00:01:38.368
on!" Ringo waved his arms.

21
00:01:38.369 --> 00:01:43.576
"No! PJ, wait!" But PJ didn't hear.

22
00:01:43.577 --> 00:01:47.223
The windmill lifted off the

23
00:01:47.224 --> 00:01:52.206
platform. Its blades started

24
00:01:52.207 --> 00:01:56.417
to turn. A bolt shot

25
00:01:56.418 --> 00:02:01.922
out and a blade fell. The

26
00:02:01.923 --> 00:02:04.438
bolt flew toward Lars. "Whoa!"

27
00:02:04.439 --> 00:02:06.345
Ringo cried.

28
00:02:06.346 --> 00:02:08.478
Lars ducked just in

29
00:02:08.479 --> 00:02:12.399
time. PJ turned off the windmill.

30
00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.925
Lars frowned at Lucy.

31
00:02:14.926 --> 00:02:18.261
"That was dumb—you worked too

32
00:02:18.262 --> 00:02:22.172
fast! No wonder

33
00:02:22.173 --> 00:02:26.215
you're still just a rookie!"

